eld/type :answer-field.type/select] ["answer-field-37dba421-36d3-5977-b5b1-852f9e3aa421" :answer-field/correct "answer-64a4d026-4e1a-5cce-880b-42dd87fa4270"] ["answer-field-37dba421-36d3-5977-b5b1-852f9e3aa421" :answer-field/choices "answer-64a4d026-4e1a-5cce-880b-42dd87fa4270"] ["answer-field-37dba421-36d3-5977-b5b1-852f9e3aa421" :answer-field/choices "answer-733c52bb-6afa-5bc5-95c0-a7e66333b6e0"] ["answer-field-c454f910-39f4-514e-b488-5dfacc09ef1d" :answer-field/id #uuid "c454f910-39f4-514e-b488-5dfacc09ef1d"] ["answer-82fb8f4e-8153-5912-b8f4-8e162eb48f70" :answer/id #uuid "82fb8f4e-8153-5912-b8f4-8e162eb48f70"] ["answer-82fb8f4e-8153-5912-b8f4-8e162eb48f70" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-82fb8f4e-8153-5912-b8f4-8e162eb48f70" :answer/value "False"] ["answer-5f06001d-c0a8-5110-aaab-05496df93977" :answer/id #uuid "5f06001d-c0a8-5110-aaab-05496df93977"] ["answer-5f06001d-c0a8-5110-aaab-05496df93977" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-5f06001d-c0a8-5110-aaab-05496df93977" :answer/value "True"] ["answer-field-c454f910-39f4-514e-b488-5dfacc09ef1d" :answer-field/key "field-4"] ["answer-field-c454f910-39f4-514e-b488-5dfacc09ef1d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select] ["answer-field-c454f910-39f4-514e-b488-5dfacc09ef1d" :answer-field/correct "answer-82fb8f4e-8153-5912-b8f4-8e162eb48f70"] ["answer-field-c454f910-39f4-514e-b488-5dfacc09ef1d" :answer-field/choices "answer-82fb8f4e-8153-5912-b8f4-8e162eb48f70"] ["answer-field-c454f910-39f4-514e-b488-5dfacc09ef1d" :answer-field/choices "answer-5f06001d-c0a8-5110-aaab-05496df93977"] ["question-e3e7079a-616c-59e7-8130-14cd0fb2782d" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-69e99acf-1398-5692-8061-029fa2a74beb"] ["question-e3e7079a-616c-59e7-8130-14cd0fb2782d" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-56723ba2-cf0d-57bb-8655-32504888775c"] ["question-e3e7079a-616c-59e7-8130-14cd0fb2782d" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-37dba421-36d3-5977-b5b1-852f9e3aa421"] ["question-e3e7079a-616c-59e7-8130-14cd0fb2782d" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-c454f910-39f4-514e-b488-5dfacc09ef1d"] [17592186221449 :knowledge-point/questions "question-e3e7079a-616c-59e7-8130-14cd0fb2782d"] ["question-ed658204-766e-56cd-a12e-1cf2b14b40f7" :question/id #uuid "ed658204-766e-56cd-a12e-1cf2b14b40f7"] ["question-ed658204-766e-56cd-a12e-1cf2b14b40f7" :question/math-academy-id "q-343391"] ["question-ed658204-766e-56cd-a12e-1cf2b14b40f7" :question/problem "Let $f(x)$ be the $2\\pi $-periodic extension of the function $F(x)=3{x}^{2}$ defined on $[-\\pi ,\\pi ).$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below, showing the derivation of a series converging to the $2\\pi $-periodic extension of \n\n$$\nG(x)={x}^{3}={\\int }_{0}^{x}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nfrom the corresponding Fourier series of $f(x).$\n\nThe Fourier series of $f(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\n3{x}^{2}∼{\\pi }^{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{12(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}{{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nSince $f$ is \n{{field-2}} \non $R,$ we may integrate its Fourier series term-by-term to get\n\n$$\n{x}^{3}∼{\\pi }^{2}x+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{{field-3}}\\cdot {{field-4}}.\n$$"] ["question-ed658204-766e-56cd-a12e-1cf2b14b40f7" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that $F(x)$ is an even function. So, the Fourier series of its $2L$-periodic extension has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{L}).\n$$\n\nIn our case, $L=\\pi $ and we are already given the coefficients for $n\\ge 1.$ Thus, the Fourier series of $f(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼{\\pi }^{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{12(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx).\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the function $F$ is continuous on $(-\\pi ,\\pi ).$ \nTherefore, the $2\\pi $-periodic extension $f$ is $\\text{piecewise continuous}$ on $R,$ so we may integrate its Fourier series term-by-term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{x}3{t}^{2}\\,\\text{d}t & ∼{\\int }_{0}^{x}({\\pi }^{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{12(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nt))\\text{d}t \\\\ [{t}^{3}]_{0}^{x} & ∼[{\\pi }^{2}t]_{0}^{x}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{12(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{2}}\\cdot [\\frac{1}{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nt)]_{0}^{x} \\\\ {x}^{3} & ∼{\\pi }^{2}x+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{12(-1)^{n}}{{n}^{3}}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-ed658204-766e-56cd-a12e-1cf2b14b40f7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-b47fccdc-c568-5695-8718-41b3bbde7ccf" :answer-field/id #uuid "b47fccdc-c568-5695-8718-41b3bbde7ccf"] ["answer-d386d763-aaac-543d-9911-63e1963b04ac" :answer/id #uuid "d386d763-aaac-543d-9911-63e1963b04ac"] ["answer-d386d763-aaac-543d-9911-63e1963b04ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d386d763-aaac-543d-9911-63e1963b04ac" :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{nx}{2})"] ["answer-b70050b3-2831-538a-98f7-589a10e9520d" :answer/id #uuid "b70050b3-2831-538a-98f7-589a10e9520d"] ["answer-b70050b3-2831-538a-98f7-589a10e9520d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b70050b3-2831-538a-98f7-589a10e9520d" :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{nx}{\\pi })"] ["answer-b4c2430c-0c6a-549e-aa2b-e39d8ffb22dc" :answer/id #uuid "b4c2430c-0c6a-549e-aa2b-e39d8ffb22dc"] ["answer-b4c2430c-0c6a-549e-aa2b-e39d8ffb22dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b4c2430c-0c6a-549e-aa2b-e39d8ffb22dc" :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)"] ["answer-b732912b-9781-517d-a1b3-41138feb28b6" :answer/id #uuid "b732912b-9781-517d-a1b3-41138feb28b6"] ["answer-b732912b-9781-517d-a1b3-41138feb28b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b732912b-9781-517d-a1b3-41138feb28b6" :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{nx}{2})"] ["answer-44d62fec-1344-5409-9e10-19b41bcbaf7b" :answer/id #uuid "44d62fec-1344-5409-9e10-19b41bcbaf7b"] ["answer-44d62fec-1344-5409-9e10-19b41bcbaf7b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-44d62fec-1344-5409-9e10-19b41bcbaf7b" :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{nx}{\\pi })"] ["answer-18700c44-863c-5283-8d80-b4ecba9f9a9b" :